  "content": "\n\n<h1><strong><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1081408/description_f81cabab-80cd-45f1-b55a-095af862f1e6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"778\" height=\"316\"></strong></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1117/31/hud-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"756\" height=\"282\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db;font-size:14px\"><strong>致謝：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">此專案基於&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><a style=\"color:#f8cac6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/vixelmc/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">@VixelMC 的</a> </span>GUI Revision，但與其無直接隸屬關係。您可以在此下載原始紋理包 <span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><a style=\"color:#f8cac6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/gui-revision\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">本包使用的部分紋理亦來自 Mandalas GUI 紋理包，原始包請至 <span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><a style=\"color:#f8cac6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-dark-mode\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">本包使用的字體為 qrafty 的 Capitalized Font，原始字體包請至 <a style=\"color:#f8cac6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/qraftys-capitalized-font\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\">這裡</span></a> 下載。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;font-size:14px\"><strong>它會新增什麼？&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\">此資源包為大多數遊戲內容器提供獨特的 GUI 紋理。此外，它也針對部分模組加入了自訂 UI 元素。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f;font-size:14px\"><strong>OptiFine？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">為了獲得最佳體驗，建議使用 OptiFine 或 OptiGUI。不過，即使沒有這些模組，此資源包也能運作良好。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9;font-size:14px\"><strong>支援的模組！</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Apple skin</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Shulkerbox tooltips</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Sophisticated backpacks</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Clayworks</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Corpse</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Cosmeticarmorreworked</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Curios</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Farmersdelight</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Farmersrespite</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Miners delight</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Roughlyenoughitems</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Sawmill</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Sophisticatedcore</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Storagedrawers</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Toms storage</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Woodworks</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">JEI</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Supplementaries</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Tinkers</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Extreme sound muffler</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Vault hunters mod</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Inventory profiles next</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#eccafa\"><span style=\"color:#eccafa\">Overflowing Bars</span></li>\n</ul>",
